  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Cut cauliflower(see ingredients) into small florets. Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies in a large baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until browned and tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-91e4cd00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, peel potato and cut into bite-sized chunks. Cook potato in the boiling water, until easily pierced with a fork, 10-15 minutes.\n• Drain and return to the pan. Add the butter and milk to the potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-4bc22810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the potato is cooking, thinly slice brown onion.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-26718320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Add onion and cook, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• SPICY! The curry paste is mild, use less if you’re sensitive to heat! Add mild curry paste and the soy sauce and cook stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add coconut milk and drained lentils and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• TIP: Add a splash of water if the curry looks too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-8c4c9c30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies are roasted, remove from the oven and transfer the lentil curry to the baking dish. Stir to combine.\n• Top with potato mash and spread out evenly.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 5-8 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine tomato, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-34a89440.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the potato-topped lentil and cauli curry pie between plates.\n• Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with tomato salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/685b5c53971405a9ee1f88bd/step-6499ec50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
